  "content": "<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/RWBie9pxqqg?si=pgStOXJ9LvGrjrDt\" title=\"YouTube 影片播放器\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n<br/><br/><br/>\n<img width=\"1020\" height=\"129\" alt=\"minecraft_title\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/99b123fe-9b03-4565-a62f-29e581bc58ad\" /><br><br>\n\n<img src=\"https://github.com/Vurbin-Team/UIKit/blob/main/headlines/about_white.png?raw=true\" alt=\"mods_required_white\" width=200><br>\n\n一款輕柔的降雪模組，讓 Minecraft 的冬季感覺溫暖、寧靜且舒適。雪花在您周圍輕柔飄落，營造出平和、愜意的氛圍！\n\n此模組會**完全**停用雨天並將其替換為下雪。\n\n也推薦搭配以下模組進行設定：\n- [cloth-config](https://modrinth.com/mod/cloth-config)\n- [modMenu](https://modrinth.com/mod/modmenu)\n- 搭配 [Sodium](https://modrinth.com/mod/sodium) 使用可獲得更好的粒子優化效果\n\n<br><br>[影片展示](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4f0a5717-d62e-416c-bda1-168e0ac79323)<br><br>\n\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1014\" alt=\"粒子雪花圖片預覽\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2932c38c-1572-4866-a147-5285515f2fea\" />",
